rawContent.text:
现在写 Java 代码。先写 common/config/security 基础层，再 entity/repository，再 dto/service/controller，再 tests。

我要非常小心编译正确性。

### WeboxApplication.java

```java
package com.webox;
import org.springframework.boot.SpringApplication;
import org.springframework.boot.autoconfigure.SpringBootApplication;
import org.springframework.boot.context.properties.ConfigurationPropertiesScan;

@SpringBootApplication
@ConfigurationPropertiesScan
public class WeboxApplication {
  public static void main(String[] args){ SpringApplication.run(WeboxApplication.class, args); }
}
```

### config/AppProperties.java

```java
package com.webox.config;
import jakarta.annotation.PostConstruct;
import lombok.Data;
import org.springframework.boot.context.properties.ConfigurationProperties;
import org.springframework.stereotype.Component;

@Data @Component
@ConfigurationProperties(prefix="webox")
public class AppProperties {
  private String jwtSecret = "";
  private int accessTokenMinutes = 30;
  private int refreshTokenDays = 7;
  private String corsOrigins = "http://localhost:5173,http://localhost:8081";
  private int menuCacheTtlSeconds = 30;
  private String llmBaseUrl = "https://api.openai.com/v1";
  private String llmApiKey = "";
  private String llmModel = "gpt-4o-mini";
  private String uploadDir = "/app/uploads";

  @PostConstruct
  public void validate() {
    if (jwtSecret == null || jwtSecret.isBlank() || jwtSecret.length() < 32)
      throw new IllegalStateException("WEBOX JWT_SECRET must be set (>=32 chars). Refusing to start.");
    if (accessTokenMinutes < 1 || refreshTokenDays < 1) ...
    if (menuCacheTtlSeconds < 1) ...
    ...
  }
  public boolean llmEnabled(){ return llmApiKey != null && !llmApiKey.isBlank(); }
}
```
注意：Spring Boot 配置属性绑定 `llm-api-key` → llmApiKey。环境变量在 application.yml 里映射 `${LLM_API_KEY:}` 到 `webox.llm-api-key`。OK。

但 `@ConfigurationProperties` 需要 setter，@Data 提供。OK。

问题：@PostConstruct 在 @ConfigurationProperties 类上作为 @Component 会被调用，绑定发生在 postProcessBeforeInitialization 之后？Spring Boot 的 ConfigurationPropertiesBindingPostProcessor 是 BeanPostProcessor，在初始化前绑定属性，@PostConstruct 在 afterPropertiesSet 之后调用（InitDestroyAnnotationBeanPostProcessor 在 postProcessBeforeInitialization 阶段调用 @PostConstruct），但绑定 postprocessor 的 order？ ConfigurationPropertiesBindingPostProcessor implements BeanPostProcessor with order Ordered.HIGHEST_PRECEDENCE + 1，会在 InitDestroyAnnotationBeanPostProcessor 之前执行（后者 order LOWEST_PRECEDENCE? 实际 InitDestroyAnnotationBeanPostProcessor 的 order 是 LOWEST_PRECEDENCE - 1?）。常见做法是把校验放在单独的配置类或 `@Validated`。为避免风险，我用另一种方式：在 WeboxApplication.main 里读取环境变量校验？不优雅。

更稳妥：用 `@ConfigurationProperties` + `@Validated` + `@NotBlank @Size(min=32)`，Spring Boot 会在绑定时校验并快速失败（需要 jakarta.validation 注解，starter-validation 已有）。`@Validated` 配合 `@NotBlank` 由 ConfigurationPropertiesBindingPostProcessor 校验。这是标准做法，可靠。

```java
@Data @Component @Validated
@ConfigurationProperties(prefix="webox")
public class AppProperties {
  @NotBlank @Size(min=32) private String jwtSecret;
  @Min(1) private int accessTokenMinutes = 30;
  ...
}
```
这样缺少 JWT_SECRET 会启动失败（快速失败）。好。用 @Validated 而非 @PostConstruct。

但注意环境变量里 JWT_SECRET 有默认值 60 字符，OK。

### common/AppClock.java

```java
public final class AppClock {
  public static final ZoneId ZONE = ZoneId.of("Asia/Shanghai");
  public static LocalDate today(){ return LocalDate.now(ZONE); }
  public static LocalDateTime now(){ return LocalDateTime.now(ZONE); }
  public static LocalTime time(){ return LocalTime.now(ZONE); }
}
```
测试 OrderRules 时用可注入的时间参数（方法接收 LocalDate/LocalTime），便于单测。

### common/Money.java

```java
public final class Money {
  public static BigDecimal toBigDecimal(long cents){ return BigDecimal.valueOf(cents, 2); }
  public static long toCents(BigDecimal v){ return v.movePointRight(2).setScale(0, RoundingMode.HALF_UP).longValueExact(); }
  public static String format(long cents){ return "¥" + toBigDecimal(cents).toPlainString(); }
  public static long multiply(long unitCents, int qty){ return Math.multiplyExact(unitCents, qty); }
  public static long sum(long... values)... 
}
```
Java varargs sum: `long total=0; for(long v:values) total=Math.addExact(total,v); return total;`

### common/TextUtil.java

```java
public static String escapeLike(String s){ return s.replace("\\","\\\\").replace("%","\\%").replace("_","\\_"); }
public static String clean(String s, int max){ if(s==null) return ""; String t=s.trim(); ... return t.length()>max? t.substring(0,max):t; }
public static List<String> splitCsv(String s)
public static String joinCsv(Collection<String>)
public static boolean matchesAllowed(String value, Set<String> allowed)
```
转义 LIKE 用于 JPQL：`LIKE CONCAT('%', :kw, '%') ESCAPE '\\'`? JPQL 支持 ESCAPE? Hibernate 支持 `escape '\\'`。 更简单：使用 Spring Data `Containing` 派生查询（参数绑定自动安全），SQL 注入防护由参数绑定保证；但 `%` 会被当作通配符（不算注入，但语义问题）。我可以在 repository 用 `@Query` 加 `ESCAPE`。为避免 JPQL ESCAPE 语法问题，我用 `LIKE %:kw%` 派生查询 + 输入清洗（去掉 `%` `_` 或转义），并在文档中说明参数化查询防注入。实际上最稳：用 Spring Data 派生方法 `findByActiveTrueAndNameContainingIgnoreCaseOr...`。但多条件（分类多选、关键词、分页）用 Specification 或 @Query 动态。

我打算用 JdbcTemplate? 不，用 JPA `@Query` 带可选参数：
```java
@Query("""
 SELECT d FROM DishEntity d WHERE d.active = true
 AND (:keyword is null or lower(d.name) like lower(concat('%', :keyword, '%')) or lower(d.description) like lower(concat('%', :keyword, '%')))
 AND (:catsEmpty = true or d.category in :categories)
 ORDER BY d.id
""")
Page<DishEntity> search(...)
```
JPQL 里 `:catsEmpty = true` 可以用 Boolean 参数。in :categories 当空集合时可能报错，用 `(:categoryCount = 0 or d.category in :categories)` — 空集合传给 `in` 在 Hibernate 6 可能报错。为避免，categories 为空时传一个不可能的值集合（如 `["__NONE__"]`）。或者用两个 @Query 分支。更简单：在 service 里用 ` Specification` 动态构造（spring-data-jpa 支持 JpaSpecificationExecutor），完全避免空集合问题且参数绑定安全。用 Specification 很优雅：

```java
public interface DishRepository extends JpaRepository<DishEntity,Long>, JpaSpecificationExecutor<DishEntity> {}
```
MenuService 构造 Specification：
```java
Specification<DishEntity> spec = (root, q, cb) -> {
  List<Predicate> ps = new ArrayList<>();
  ps.add(cb.isTrue(root.get("active")));
  if (keyword != null && !keyword.isBlank()) {
    String kw = "%" + TextUtil.escapeLike(keyword.toLowerCase()) + "%";
    ps.add(cb.or(
      cb.like(cb.lower(root.get("name")), kw, '\\'),
      cb.like(cb.lower(root.get("description")), kw, '\\')));
  }
  if (!categories.isEmpty()) ps.add(root.get("category").in(categories));
  return cb.and(ps.toArray(new Predicate[0]));
};
```
`cb.like(expr, pattern, escapeChar)` 支持转义字符参数。好，参数化 + 转义，SQL 注入防护满分。

分页：`dishRepository.findAll(spec, PageRequest.of(page,size, Sort.by("id")))` 返回 Page<DishEntity>。然后组装 MenuItemView（含库存、选项组）。

### common/ApiResponse / ApiException / ErrorCode / GlobalExceptionHandler / RequestIdFilter / JsonLog

ApiResponse:
```java
public record ApiResponse<T>(boolean success, T data, ErrorBody error, String requestId) {
  public static <T> ApiResponse<T> ok(T data){ return new ApiResponse<>(true,data,null,RequestContext.requestId()); }
  public static <T> ApiResponse<T> fail(String code, String message){ return new ApiResponse<>(false,null,new ErrorBody(code,message),RequestContext.requestId()); }
  public record ErrorBody(String code, String message){}
}
```

RequestContext: ThreadLocal<String> requestId + static get/set/clear.

ErrorCode enum: VALIDATION_ERROR(400), UNAUTHORIZED(401), FORBIDDEN(403), NOT_FOUND(404), CONFLICT(409), RULE_VIOLATION(422), RATE_LIMIT? , INTERNAL_ERROR(500), STOCK_INSUFFICIENT(409), DUPLICATE_ORDER(409), AI_UNAVAILABLE(502).

ApiException extends RuntimeException with ErrorCode and optional details.

GlobalExceptionHandler handles ApiException, MethodArgumentNotValidException, ConstraintViolationException, DataIntegrityViolationException, IllegalArgumentException, Exception. Returns ResponseEntity<ApiResponse<?>>.

RequestIdFilter extends OncePerRequestFilter: generate UUID or use X-Request-ID header, set ThreadLocal, add response header, log request in JSON (method, path, status, durationMs), clear in finally.

JsonLog: uses System.out.println of JSON string via ObjectMapper? Simpler: `LoggerFactory.getLogger(...)` with structured message. I'll write a small `JsonLog.info(String event, Object... kv)` using org.slf4j and manual JSON string building. Need escaping — use Jackson ObjectMapper writeValueAsString(Map). Spring Boot has Jackson. Use static ObjectMapper. Good.

### security

PasswordHasher (PBKDF2):
```java
@Component
public class PasswordHasher {
  private static final int ITER=120000; private static final int SALT=16; private static final int KEY=256;
  public String hash(String raw) {...}
  public boolean matches(String raw, String stored) {
    String[] p = stored.split("\\$"); // ["pbkdf2","120000","salt","hash"]
    ...
    return MessageDigest.isEqual(expected, actual);
  }
}
```
`split("\\$")` 在 Java 字符串中 "\\$" 是 regex 转义 `$`。对。

JwtUtil:
```java
@Component
public class JwtUtil {
  private final AppProperties props; private final ObjectMapper mapper = new ObjectMapper();
  public String issue(long userId, String email, String role) {
     long now = Instant.now().getEpochSecond();
     Map<String,Object> p = new LinkedHashMap<>();
     p.put("sub", String.valueOf(userId)); p.put("email",email); p.put("role",role);
     p.put("iat",now); p.put("exp", now + props.getAccessTokenMinutes()*60L); p.put("jti", UUID.randomUUID().toString());
     String h = b64(mapper.writeValueAsBytes(Map.of("alg","HS256","typ","JWT")));
     String pl = b64(mapper.writeValueAsBytes(p));
     return h+"."+pl+"."+b64(hmac((h+"."+pl).getBytes(UTF_8)));
  }
  public Claims verify(String token) throws ApiException { ... }
}
```
verify 检查签名（MessageDigest.isEqual）、exp、返回 record JwtClaims(long userId, String email, String role).

Mac.getInstance("HmacSHA256"), SecretKeySpec(props.getJwtSecret().getBytes(UTF_8), "HmacSHA256").

Base64.getUrlEncoder().withoutPadding().

AuthInterceptor:
```java
@Component
public class AuthInterceptor implements HandlerInterceptor {
  private final JwtUtil jwt;
  @Override public boolean preHandle(HttpServletRequest req, HttpServletResponse res, Object handler) {
    RequestContext.clearUser()? 
    String path = req.getRequestURI();
    if (path.startsWith("/health") || path.startsWith("/ready") || path.startsWith("/api/auth/") || path.startsWith("/api/meta") || "OPTIONS".equalsIgnoreCase(req.getMethod())) return true;
    // /api/menu/stream SSE with EventSource cannot set Authorization header; allow token via query? PRD/expert says token not in URL. For SSE use cookie 'webox_access'? Hmm.
```
Wait: SSE EventSource can't set Authorization header. Solution: use a short-lived one-time SSE ticket: `GET /api/sse-ticket` returns a random ticket (authenticated), then `EventSource('/api/menu/stream?ticket=...')`. The ticket is not the access token, it's a single-purpose short-lived credential stored server-side (or signed). That satisfies "token must not be in URL" (access token isn't). Or use fetch-based stream reading (ReadableStream) with Authorization header — modern browsers support streaming fetch. Simpler: use `fetch` with POST + ReadableStream for AI (already need POST), and for stock stream use `EventSource` with a one-time ticket.

Simplest robust: implement SSE stock updates via polling with ETag? But PRD requires real-time without manual refresh; polling every 5s still counts as "real-time without manual refresh" technically (auto refresh), but SSE is better. I'll use fetch-based streaming for both: a small JS helper `streamSse(path, {method, body, onEvent})` using `fetch` with `Authorization` header and `response.body.getReader()` to parse SSE chunks. This avoids URL tokens entirely and works for POST AI. 

So backend SSE endpoints require normal Bearer auth. Interceptor handles all /api/** except auth endpoints, /api/meta.

Role check: methods annotated with @RequireRole("ADMIN") on controller class/method. HandlerInterceptor's `handler` is HandlerMethod; check annotation.

Also need CORS preflight (OPTIONS) skip. Since nginx same-origin, minor.

WebConfig:
```java
@Configuration @RequiredArgsConstructor
public class WebConfig implements WebMvcConfigurer {
  private final AuthInterceptor authInterceptor; private final AppProperties props;
  @Override public void addInterceptors(InterceptorRegistry registry) {
    registry.addInterceptor(authInterceptor).addPathPatterns("/api/**");
  }
  @Override public void addCorsMappings(CorsRegistry registry) {
    registry.addMapping("/api/**")
      .allowedOrigins(props.getCorsOrigins().split(","))
      .allowedMethods("GET","POST","PUT","PATCH","DELETE","OPTIONS")
      .allowedHeaders("*").allowCredentials(true).maxAge(3600);
  }
}
```
Note: `allowedOrigins` with allowCredentials(true) and explicit origins is fine (not wildcard).

CurrentUser record + holder in RequestContext.

### entity classes

Lombok @Data. Use `@Column(name=...)` explicit names matching SQL. Boolean with `@Column(name="active") private boolean active;` Hibernate maps boolean to bit/tinyint. With ddl-auto=none, reading tinyint(1) into boolean works. Need to ensure Hibernate doesn't complain about column type validation (ddl-auto=none skips validation). OK.

Date types: LocalDate, LocalDateTime.

BigDecimal for price, budget, amounts.

`@Enumerated`? use String role/status/mealPeriod.

OrderEntity.idempotencyKey nullable unique.

DailyMenuEntity.version with @Version for optimistic locking (but I'll use atomic UPDATE via @Modifying query to avoid lost updates; @Version may interfere with bulk update but that's fine). Actually if I use @Version on entity and also bulk update, version isn't auto incremented in bulk update. I'll do manual `version = version + 1` in bulk query. Or skip @Version and use atomic conditional UPDATE only. Simpler: no @Version annotation, just a plain version integer column incremented in the atomic update. Good.

### repositories

- UserRepository extends JpaRepository<UserEntity,Long>: Optional<UserEntity> findByEmail(String email) — need case-insensitive? use findByEmailIgnoreCase.
- RefreshTokenRepository: Optional<RefreshTokenEntity> findByTokenHash(String hash); void deleteByUserId...; @Modifying @Query revoke.
