To keep robust and not overly complex, I'll structure:
1. Build candidates and reasons locally regardless (deterministic reasons).
2. If LLM enabled: stream its reasoning tokens as "delta" events, then parse `[[DISH:id]]` markers; LLM-selected ids map to candidates; for each, use LLM-provided reason if parseable, else local reason.
3. If no LLM or LLM failed/parsed nothing: use local top 3, stream local reason chunks as "delta" (word groups) then dish cards.
4. Always send `done`.

`callLlmStreaming` returns accumulated text; uses HttpClient.

```java
private String callLlmStreaming(SseEmitter emitter, String prompt) throws Exception {
  String url = props.getLlmBaseUrl().replaceAll("/$","") + "/chat/completions";
  String body = mapper.writeValueAsString(Map.of(
    "model", props.getLlmModel(),
    "stream", true,
    "messages", List.of(
      Map.of("role","system","content", SYSTEM_PROMPT),
      Map.of("role","user","content", prompt))));
  HttpClient client = HttpClient.newBuilder().connectTimeout(Duration.ofSeconds(10)).build();
  HttpRequest request = HttpRequest.newBuilder(URI.create(url))
    .timeout(Duration.ofSeconds(90))
    .header("Content-Type","application/json")
    .header("Authorization","Bearer " + props.getLlmApiKey())
    .header("Accept","text/event-stream")
    .POST(BodyPublishers.ofString(body, UTF_8)).build();
  HttpResponse<InputStream> response = client.send(request, BodyHandlers.ofInputStream());
  if (response.statusCode() >= 400) throw new IllegalStateException("LLM HTTP " + status);
  StringBuilder acc = new StringBuilder();
  try (BufferedReader reader = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(response.body(), UTF_8))) {
     String line;
     while ((line = reader.readLine()) != null) {
        if (!line.startsWith("data:")) continue;
        String data = line.substring(5).trim();
        if (data.isEmpty() || "[DONE]".equals(data)) continue;
        try {
          JsonNode node = mapper.readTree(data);
          String delta = node.path("choices").path(0).path("delta").path("content").asText("");
          if (!delta.isBlank()) { acc.append(delta); send(emitter, "delta", Map.of("text", delta)); }
        } catch (Exception ignored) {}
     }
  }
  return acc.toString();
}
